k {\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .bullet-icon {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #2b6cb0;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  th {\n    background: #eef2f7;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  td.analysis {\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .highlight-red {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .redbox {\n    border: 1px solid #c0392b;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n  .corner-marks {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    right: 8px;\n    color: #2b6cb0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"title\">不满意分析—大平台渠道</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <!-- Left column -->\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">本周不满意出错类型:</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        [Pie Chart: 客户问题层面 50%, 业务知识层面 27%, 服务技巧 23%]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pie-legend\">\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#4472c4;\"></span>客户问题层面 50%</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ed7d31;\"></span>业务知识层面 27%</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#a5a5a5;\"></span>服务技巧 23%</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bullet-block\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-icon\">&#128161;</div>\n        <div>\n          业务知识层面导致的服务不满意仍为当前主要薹弱点，针对业务知识，定期收集整理不满意会话进行集中培训\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right column -->\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <div class=\"section-title-right\">不达标客服明细</div>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>姓名</th>\n            <th>客服</th>\n            <th>满意度</th>\n            <th>不满意数</th>\n            <th>满意数</th>\n            <th>达标差值</th>\n            <th>不满意分析</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>89.23%</td>\n            <td>5</td>\n            <td>44</td>\n            <td class=\"highlight-red\">151</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.无法达到到客户的加期需求需求，客服未能满足工作岗位职责的客户要求<br>\n              2.客户反映客服的产品知识不足，对客户问题回复不及时或答非所问<br>\n              3.正在解答客户问题时沟通方式不当，让客户感觉冷漠\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>89.09%</td>\n            <td>4</td>\n            <td>35</td>\n            <td class=\"highlight-red\">121</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.未对客户反馈的产品咨询问题给予耐心解释<br>\n              2.处理客户投诉的服务态度不够积极，客户满意度产品<br>\n              解答个人权益的问题，客户对满意度了解不足\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>95.00%</td>\n            <td>3</td>\n            <td>57</td>\n            <td>60</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.未对客户投诉产品咨询为什么不了解使用体验，客服<br>\n              回复了产品的服务过程使用的，客服仅仅提供了产品<br>\n              的解决使用的，后期跟进不满意客户产品<br>\n              <span class=\"redbox\">已核实3条不满意行为需按照标准处罚</span>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>96.00%</td>\n            <td>3</td>\n            <td>71</td>\n            <td>46</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.客户对产品的服务态度不满意，需要进一步提升沟通能力<br>\n              2.对客户问题解答不够全面，导致客户满意度下降\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>96.77%</td>\n            <td>3</td>\n            <td>88</td>\n            <td>29</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.客户对产品咨询回复不够及时，一次性解决率不高<br>\n              2.对客户问题的跟进处理不到位\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>[illegible]</td>\n            <td>97.00%</td>\n            <td>3</td>\n            <td>13</td>\n            <td>6</td>\n            <td class=\"analysis\">\n              1.对客户投诉的处理不够彻底，但是数量较少影响较小<br>\n              反馈知晓客户问题\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
